        "type": "generative",
        "visual_code": "<section class=\"bg-[#0F0F10] text-[#F4F4F9] py-24 px-6 font-['Bricolage_Grotesque']\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n    <div class=\"text-center mb-20\">\n      <span class=\"text-[#E2D1C3] font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.5em] uppercase block mb-4\">[ REPORT // SOCIAL_PROOF ]</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-5xl md:text-8xl font-black mb-6 uppercase tracking-tighter italic\">\n        THE ARCHITECTS <span class=\"text-[#E2D1C3] not-italic\">OF THE NEW ERA</span>\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"text-[#E2D1C3]/60 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed\">Voices of a movement redefining the DNA of Parisian craft for the global street.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch\">\n      <!-- LEFT NODE: THE STYLIST -->\n      <div class=\"border-l border-t border-[#E2D1C3]/20 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:bg-[#E2D1C3]/5 transition-all duration-500\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E2D1C3]/40 mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest\">COORD // 01.A</p>\n          <p class=\"text-xl font-light leading-snug mb-8 opacity-90\">\n            \"The craftsmanship rivals Paris, but the heart is strictly for the streets.\"\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <img src=\"testimonial_002_url\" alt=\"Elena Rodriguez\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#E2D1C3]/30 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\">Elena Rodriguez</p>\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E2D1C3]\">Lead Stylist</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-[#E2D1C3]/10\">\n            <p class=\"text-3xl font-black\">4.9/5</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40\">Verified Design Rating</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- CENTER NODE: THE ANCHOR (MARCUS) -->\n      <div class=\"bg-[#161617] border-x border-[#E2D1C3]/40 p-10 md:p-12 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden\">\n        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#E2D1C3] to-transparent\"></div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E2D1C3] mb-12 uppercase tracking-widest text-center\">[ CORE_NODE // 02.B ]</p>\n          <p class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium leading-[1.1] mb-12 text-center\">\n            \"Nectar doesn't just provide clothes; they provide a <span class=\"text-[#E2D1C3] italic\">sense of belonging</span>. It's a revolutionary shift for our community.\"\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-8\">\n          <div class=\"text-center\">\n            <img src=\"testimonial_001_url\" alt=\"Marcus Thorne\" class=\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full border-2 border-[#E2D1C3] mb-4 mx-auto\">\n            <p class=\"text-xl font-black uppercase tracking-tighter\">Marcus Thorne</p>\n            <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#E2D1C3]\">Director, Metro Youth Alliance</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center bg-[#E2D1C3] text-[#0F0F10] px-6 py-4 rounded-sm\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase\">Active Community</p>\n            <p class=\"text-2xl font-black tracking-tighter\">15K+</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- RIGHT NODE: THE FOUNDER -->\n      <div class=\"border-r border-t border-[#E2D1C3]/20 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between group hover:bg-[#E2D1C3]/5 transition-all duration-500\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs font-mono text-[#E2D1C3]/40 mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest text-right\">COORD // 03.C</p>\n          <p class=\"text-xl font-light leading-snug mb-8 opacity-90\">\n            \"Dismantling barriers while maintaining an elite aesthetic. Luxury is how you feel in your skin.\"\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n            <img src=\"testimonial_004_url\" alt=\"Amara Okafor\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-[#E2D1C3]/30 grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-tight\">Amara Okafor</p>\n              <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E2D1C3]\">Founder, New Thread</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pt-6 border-t border-[#E2D1C3]/10\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-1\">\n              <p class=\"text-3xl font-black\">98%</p>\n              <p class=\"text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-40 mb-1\">Sentiment</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-1 bg-[#E2D1C3]/10 w-full\">\n              <div class=\"h-full bg-[#E2D1C3] w-[98%]\"></div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"mt-16 text-center\">\n      <div class=\"h-px w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#E2D1C3]/20 to-transparent mb-8\"></div>\n      <p class=\"text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-[#E2D1C3]/30\">End of Transmission // Verified Authenticity 2024</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
